'French':[Q('Which French greeting means “Good morning/Hello”?',['Bonjour','Bonsoir','Merci','Au revoir'],0,'Bonjour is a common daytime greeting.'),Q('What does “merci” mean in English?',['Please','Thank you','Goodbye','Sorry'],1,'Merci means thank you.'),Q('Choose the French word for “book”.',['maison','livre','eau','pomme'],1,'Livre means book.'),Q('“Au revoir” is used when ___.',['saying goodbye','saying thank you','asking the time','introducing food'],0,'Au revoir means goodbye.'),Q('What is the French word for “water”?',['pain','eau','lait','soleil'],1,'Eau means water.'),Q('“Je m’appelle Amina” means ___.',['I am hungry','My name is Amina','I am going home','I am a teacher'],1,'Je m’appelle introduces a person’s name.'),Q('Which word means “yes” in French?',['non','oui','peut-être','jamais'],1,'Oui means yes.'),Q('What does “s’il vous plaît” mean?',['Excuse me','Please','Welcome','Good night'],1,'S’il vous plaît is a polite way to say please.')],
